 Optional Night Battles have been added for Ground Realistic Battles (GRB):


 In the gamemode selection window (under the “To Battle!” button), on GRB section, a button has been added that you can click on to go to the night battles window area;
 From this window, the option to enable night battles is available and the rewards that you can obtain are listed;
 In a tank’s modification window that is Battle Rating of 10.0 and higher, NVD/Thermal vision devices have a “Night battles” button that can be clicked on to open the night battles window; 
 The full list of rewards and further details can be seen in our Roadmap news here.

