If you ever fancied to buy one of the War Thunder Advanced Packs from Steam, now is the perfect time to do so! With the War Thunder Mega Pack, you will receive a total of four Advanced packs including Premium Vehicles, plenty of Golden Eagles and a Premium Account to last you well through the holidays and far beyond!

Included in the War Thunder Mega Pack are:

The Ace Advanced Pack, giving you access to the bundle-only Typhoon Mk.IB fighter aircraft (GB) and Pe-2-205 tactical bomber (USSR), 60 days of Premium Account and 10.000 Golden Eagles;
The Mustang Advanced Pack, giving you access to the bundle-only P-51D-20 fighter aircraft (USA), 15 days of Premium Account and 2.000 Golden Eagles;
